content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "City Resident",
      "description": "Person using bikes and stations for city transport."
    },
    {
      "name": "Bike Station",
      "description": "Place where bikes are docked, rented, or returned.",
      "attributes": [
        "Location",
        "Availability Status"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Availability Status",
      "description": "Shows if bikes or docks are available at a station."
    },
    {
      "name": "Location",
      "description": "Represents a specific area or address of a station or event."
    },
    {
      "name": "Bike Ride",
      "description": "Represents a single trip taken by a user.",
      "attributes": [
        "Price"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bike",
      "description": "Physical bicycle that can be rented for rides.",
      "attributes": [
        "Condition"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Worker",
      "description": "Checks and repairs bikes to keep them in good shape."
    },
    {
      "name": "Bike Usage Data",
      "description": "Aggregated information about bike rides and usage patterns."
    },
    {
      "name": "City Planner",
      "description": "Analyzes data to improve bike network placement and policies."
    },
    {
      "name": "Docking Station Manager",
      "description": "Oversees station operations and ensures bike availability."
    },
    {
      "name": "Dock",
      "description": "Single locking spot at a station for one bike."
    },
    {
      "name": "Reservation",
      "description": "Holds a bike temporarily for a rider before a trip."
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment",
      "description": "Transaction made for rides or subscriptions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Repair Log",
      "description": "Record of repairs made to a bike."
    },
    {
      "name": "Damage Report",
      "description": "Report from a user about a broken or malfunctioning bike."
    },
    {
      "name": "Ride History",
      "description": "List of past rides taken by a city resident."
    },
    {
      "name": "System Administrator",
      "description": "Manages overall operations and technical aspects of the bike system."
    },
    {
      "name": "Bike Inspection",
      "description": "Regular check to ensure a bike meets safety and maintenance standards."
    },
    {
      "name": "Theft Report",
      "description": "Notice filed when a bike goes missing or is stolen."
    },
    {
      "name": "Community Event",
      "description": "Public activity promoting bike use and sustainability.",
      "attributes": [
        "Bike Station",
        "Date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Community Event Manager",
      "description": "Organizes and oversees community biking events."
    },
    {
      "name": "Bike Delivery",
      "description": "Process of moving bikes between stations to balance availability.",
      "attributes": [
        "Bike"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bike Delivery Worker",
      "description": "Performs bike redistribution tasks between stations."
    }
  ]
}
```
